{"lang":"bn","rtl":false,"p":[["নমস্কার","nomoshkar","नमस्कार","Hello (respectful)","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["কেমন আছেন?","kemon achhen?","आप कैसे हैं?","How are you? (polite)","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["কেমন আছো?","kemon achho?","तुम कैसे हो?","How are you? (to a friend)","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["আমি ভালো আছি","ami bhalo achhi","मैं ठीक हूँ","I am well","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["আপনি কেমন আছেন?","apni kemon achhen?","और आप कैसे हैं?","And how are you?","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["অনেক দিন পর দেখা হলো","onek din por dekha holo","बहुत दिनों बाद मिले","We meet after a long time","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["আপনার সাথে দেখা হয়ে ভালো লাগল","apnar shathe dekha hoye bhalo laglo","आपसे मिलकर अच्छा लगा","It was good to meet you","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["শুভ সকাল","shubho shokal","सुप्रभात","Good morning","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["শুভ সন্ধ্যা","shubho shondhya","शुभ संध्या","Good evening","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["শুভ রাত্রি","shubho ratri","शुभ रात्रि","Good night","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["স্বাগতম","shagotom","स्वागत है","Welcome","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["আসুন, বসুন","ashun, boshun","आइए, बैठिए","Please come in, please sit","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["আবার দেখা হবে","abar dekha hobe","फिर मिलेंगे","We will meet again","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["আসি","ashi","चलता हूँ (शब्दशः: आता हूँ)","Goodbye (literally \"I come\")","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["ভালো থাকবেন","bhalo thakben","अपना ध्यान रखिएगा, ठीक रहिएगा","Stay well; take care","/bangla/phrases/greetings/","p"],["আমার নাম অমন","amar nam Aman","मेरा नाम अमन है","My name is Aman","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আপনার নাম কী?","apnar nam ki?","आपका नाम क्या है?","What is your name?","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আমি ভারত থেকে এসেছি","ami bharot theke eshechhi","मैं भारत से आया हूँ","I have come from India","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আপনি কোথায় থাকেন?","apni kothay thaken?","आप कहाँ रहते हैं?","Where do you live?","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আমি লুধিয়ানায় থাকি","ami Ludhianay thaki","मैं लुधियाना में रहता हूँ","I live in Ludhiana","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আমি ছাত্র","ami chhatro","मैं छात्र हूँ","I am a student","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আমি চাকরি করি","ami chakri kori","मैं नौकरी करता हूँ","I have a job","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আপনি কী করেন?","apni ki koren?","आप क्या करते हैं?","What do you do?","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আমার বয়স কুড়ি বছর","amar boyosh kuri bochhor","मेरी उम्र बीस साल है","I am twenty years old","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আমি বাংলা শিখছি","ami bangla shikhchhi","मैं बांग्ला सीख रहा हूँ","I am learning Bangla","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আমি একটু একটু বাংলা বলতে পারি","ami ektu ektu bangla bolte pari","मैं थोड़ी-थोड़ी बांग्ला बोल लेता हूँ","I can speak a little Bangla","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আপনি কি হিন্দি জানেন?","apni ki hindi janen?","क्या आप हिंदी जानते हैं?","Do you know Hindi?","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["ইনি আমার বন্ধু","ini amar bondhu","ये मेरे मित्र हैं","This is my friend (respectful)","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["আমার বাড়ি পাঞ্জাবে","amar bari panjabe","मेरा घर पंजाब में है","My home is in Punjab","/bangla/phrases/introductions/","p"],["হ্যাঁ","hyan","हाँ","Yes","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["না","na","नहीं","No","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["ধন্যবাদ","dhonnobad","धन्यवाद","Thank you","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["অনেক ধন্যবাদ","onek dhonnobad","बहुत धन्यवाद","Thank you very much","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["দয়া করে","doya kore","कृपया","Please","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["মাফ করবেন","maf korben","माफ़ कीजिए","Excuse me; I am sorry","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["আমি দুঃখিত","ami dukkhito","मुझे खेद है","I am sorry (formal)","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["ঠিক আছে","thik achhe","ठीक है","All right; okay","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["কোনো ব্যাপার না","kono byapar na","कोई बात नहीं","It does not matter","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["একটু শুনবেন?","ektu shunben?","ज़रा सुनेंगे?","Excuse me, could you listen for a moment?","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["আমি বুঝতে পারছি না","ami bujhte parchhi na","मुझे समझ नहीं आ रहा","I do not understand","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["আস্তে বলুন","aste bolun","धीरे बोलिए","Please speak slowly","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["আবার বলুন","abar bolun","फिर से कहिए","Please say it again","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["আমি জানি না","ami jani na","मुझे नहीं पता","I do not know","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["একটু সাহায্য করবেন?","ektu shahajjo korben?","थोड़ी मदद करेंगे?","Will you help me a little?","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["খুব ভালো","khub bhalo","बहुत अच्छा","Very good","/bangla/phrases/courtesy/","p"],["আমার খিদে পেয়েছে","amar khide peyechhe","मुझे भूख लगी है","I am hungry","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["একটু জল দিন","ektu jol din","थोड़ा पानी दीजिए","Please give me some water","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["চা খাবেন?","cha khaben?","चाय लेंगे?","Will you have tea?","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["হ্যাঁ, এক কাপ চা","hyan, ek kap cha","हाँ, एक कप चाय","Yes, a cup of tea","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["কী কী আছে?","ki ki achhe?","क्या-क्या है?","What do you have?","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["এটা দিন","eta din","यह दीजिए","Please give me this","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["আমি নিরামিষ খাই","ami niramish khai","मैं शाकाहारी खाना खाता हूँ","I eat vegetarian food","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["আমি মাছ-মাংস খাই না","ami machh-mangsho khai na","मैं मछली-मांस नहीं खाता","I do not eat fish or meat","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["ঝাল কম দেবেন","jhal kom deben","तीखा कम रखिएगा","Please make it less spicy","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["খুব ভালো হয়েছে","khub bhalo hoyechhe","बहुत अच्छा बना है","It has turned out very well","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["দারুণ স্বাদ","darun shad","ज़बरदस्त स्वाद","Wonderful taste","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["আর একটু নিন","ar ektu nin","थोड़ा और लीजिए","Please take a little more","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["না, আর না। পেট ভরে গেছে","na, ar na. pet bhore gechhe","नहीं, और नहीं। पेट भर गया","No more, thank you. I am full","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["মিষ্টি খাবেন?","mishti khaben?","मिठाई खाएँगे?","Will you have a sweet?","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["বিলটা দিন","bilta din","बिल दे दीजिए","The bill, please","/bangla/phrases/food/","p"],["এটার দাম কত?","etar dam koto?","इसका दाम कितना है?","What is the price of this?","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["খুব বেশি দাম","khub beshi dam","बहुत ज़्यादा दाम है","The price is too high","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["একটু কম করুন","ektu kom korun","थोड़ा कम कीजिए","Please reduce it a little","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["আমি এটা নেব","ami eta nebo","मैं यह लूँगा","I will take this","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["অন্য রং আছে?","onno rong achhe?","कोई और रंग है?","Do you have another colour?","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["স্টেশন কোথায়?","steshon kothay?","स्टेशन कहाँ है?","Where is the station?","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["এখান থেকে কত দূর?","ekhan theke koto dur?","यहाँ से कितनी दूर है?","How far is it from here?","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["সোজা যান","shoja jan","सीधे जाइए","Go straight","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["ডান দিকে যান","dan dike jan","दाईं ओर जाइए","Go to the right","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["বাঁ দিকে যান","ban dike jan","बाईं ओर जाइए","Go to the left","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["এখানে থামুন","ekhane thamun","यहाँ रुकिए","Please stop here","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["হাওড়া যাবেন?","haora jaben?","हावड़ा चलेंगे?","Will you go to Howrah?","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["ভাড়া কত?","bhara koto?","किराया कितना है?","What is the fare?","/bangla/phrases/market-and-travel/","p"],["এই বাস কোথায় যাবে?","ei bas kothay jabe?","यह बस कह